{"parse": {"title": "主线故事/CG鉴赏", "pageid": 25939, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><h2><span id=\".E5.BA.8F.E7.AB.A0_.E6.AD.A4.E5.8D.B3.E6.98.8E.E6.97.A5\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"序章_此即明日\">序章 此即明日</span></h2>\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:%E8%BF%9C%E5%A4%84%E7%9A%84%E8%80%81%E9%BC%A0.png\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"远处的老鼠.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/19/%E8%BF%9C%E5%A4%84%E7%9A%84%E8%80%81%E9%BC%A0.png/400px-%E8%BF%9C%E5%A4%84%E7%9A%84%E8%80%81%E9%BC%A0.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"400\" height=\"167\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/19/%E8%BF%9C%E5%A4%84%E7%9A%84%E8%80%81%E9%BC%A0.png/600px-%E8%BF%9C%E5%A4%84%E7%9A%84%E8%80%81%E9%BC%A0.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/19/%E8%BF%9C%E5%A4%84%E7%9A%84%E8%80%81%E9%BC%A0.png/800px-%E8%BF%9C%E5%A4%84%E7%9A%84%E8%80%81%E9%BC%A0.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a>\n</p><p><big>远处的老鼠</big>  <sub>A Rat from Afar</sub>\n</p><p><small>少有人见过这种样式的炮潜，但是见过它的人终生难忘。</small>\n</p><p><br />\n<a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:%E5%96%A7%E5%9A%A3%E4%B9%8B%E5%90%8E.png\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"喧嚣之后.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/90/%E5%96%A7%E5%9A%A3%E4%B9%8B%E5%90%8E.png/400px-%E5%96%A7%E5%9A%A3%E4%B9%8B%E5%90%8E.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"400\" height=\"167\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/90/%E5%96%A7%E5%9A%A3%E4%B9%8B%E5%90%8E.png/600px-%E5%96%A7%E5%9A%A3%E4%B9%8B%E5%90%8E.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/90/%E5%96%A7%E5%9A%A3%E4%B9%8B%E5%90%8E.png/800px-%E5%96%A7%E5%9A%A3%E4%B9%8B%E5%90%8E.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a>\n</p><p><big>喧嚣之后</big>  <sub>After the Chaos</sub>\n</p><p><small>星锑永远地失去了她的小船。</small>\n</p><p><small>Monday, 3rd June, 1966, 12:09 p.m.\nRequiescat in pace.</small>\n</p><p><br />\n<a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:%E6%98%9F%E9%94%91%E7%9A%84%E6%89%BF%E8%AF%BA.png\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"星锑的承诺.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/%E6%98%9F%E9%94%91%E7%9A%84%E6%89%BF%E8%AF%BA.png/400px-%E6%98%9F%E9%94%91%E7%9A%84%E6%89%BF%E8%AF%BA.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"400\" height=\"167\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/%E6%98%9F%E9%94%91%E7%9A%84%E6%89%BF%E8%AF%BA.png/600px-%E6%98%9F%E9%94%91%E7%9A%84%E6%89%BF%E8%AF%BA.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/%E6%98%9F%E9%94%91%E7%9A%84%E6%89%BF%E8%AF%BA.png/800px-%E6%98%9F%E9%94%91%E7%9A%84%E6%89%BF%E8%AF%BA.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a>\n</p><p><big>星锑的承诺</big>  <sub>Regulus' Promise</sub>\n</p><p><small>星锑的花招只耍一次，或无数次。</small>\n</p><p><br />\n<a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:%E6%96%B0%E9%80%A0%E5%9E%8B.png\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"新造型.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/85/%E6%96%B0%E9%80%A0%E5%9E%8B.png/400px-%E6%96%B0%E9%80%A0%E5%9E%8B.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"400\" height=\"167\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/85/%E6%96%B0%E9%80%A0%E5%9E%8B.png/600px-%E6%96%B0%E9%80%A0%E5%9E%8B.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/85/%E6%96%B0%E9%80%A0%E5%9E%8B.png/800px-%E6%96%B0%E9%80%A0%E5%9E%8B.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a>\n</p><p><big>新造型</big>  <sub>New Look</sub>\n</p><p><small>不得不说，它很适合一位特立独行的摇滚骑师。</small>\n</p><p><br />\n<a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:%E8%B6%8A%E8%BF%87%E6%9A%B4%E9%9B%A8.png\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"越过暴雨.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e7/%E8%B6%8A%E8%BF%87%E6%9A%B4%E9%9B%A8.png/400px-%E8%B6%8A%E8%BF%87%E6%9A%B4%E9%9B%A8.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"400\" height=\"167\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e7/%E8%B6%8A%E8%BF%87%E6%9A%B4%E9%9B%A8.png/600px-%E8%B6%8A%E8%BF%87%E6%9A%B4%E9%9B%A8.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e7/%E8%B6%8A%E8%BF%87%E6%9A%B4%E9%9B%A8.png/800px-%E8%B6%8A%E8%BF%87%E6%9A%B4%E9%9B%A8.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a>\n</p><p><big>过暴雨</big>  <sub>Brave the \"Storm\"</sub>\n</p><p><small>天空褪去色彩，现在它们终于平静下来了。</small>\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\".E7.AC.AC.E4.B8.80.E7.AB.A0_.E5.9C.A8.E6.88.91.E4.BB.AC.E7.9A.84.E6.97.B6.E4.BB.A3\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"第一章_在我们的时代\">第一章 在我们的时代</span></h2>\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:%E7%99%BD%E8%89%B2%E7%9F%B3%E5%A2%99.png\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"白色石墙.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f7/%E7%99%BD%E8%89%B2%E7%9F%B3%E5%A2%99.png/400px-%E7%99%BD%E8%89%B2%E7%9F%B3%E5%A2%99.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"400\" height=\"167\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f7/%E7%99%BD%E8%89%B2%E7%9F%B3%E5%A2%99.png/600px-%E7%99%BD%E8%89%B2%E7%9F%B3%E5%A2%99.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f7/%E7%99%BD%E8%89%B2%E7%9F%B3%E5%A2%99.png/800px-%E7%99%BD%E8%89%B2%E7%9F%B3%E5%A2%99.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a>\n</p><p><big>白色石墙</big>  <sub>White Stonewall</sub>\n</p><p><small>詹姆斯·克拉克，彼得·古森贝，法兰克·古森贝。</small>\n</p><p><small>也许还会有人记得他们，也许不会。</small>\n</p><p><br />\n<a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:%E5%8F%A6%E4%B8%80%E7%A7%8D%E7%BA%A2.png\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"另一种红.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/00/%E5%8F%A6%E4%B8%80%E7%A7%8D%E7%BA%A2.png/400px-%E5%8F%A6%E4%B8%80%E7%A7%8D%E7%BA%A2.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"400\" height=\"167\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/00/%E5%8F%A6%E4%B8%80%E7%A7%8D%E7%BA%A2.png/600px-%E5%8F%A6%E4%B8%80%E7%A7%8D%E7%BA%A2.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/00/%E5%8F%A6%E4%B8%80%E7%A7%8D%E7%BA%A2.png/800px-%E5%8F%A6%E4%B8%80%E7%A7%8D%E7%BA%A2.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a>\n</p><p><br />\n<a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:%E6%83%85%E4%BA%BA%E8%8A%82.png\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"情人节.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/96/%E6%83%85%E4%BA%BA%E8%8A%82.png/400px-%E6%83%85%E4%BA%BA%E8%8A%82.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"400\" height=\"167\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/96/%E6%83%85%E4%BA%BA%E8%8A%82.png/600px-%E6%83%85%E4%BA%BA%E8%8A%82.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/96/%E6%83%85%E4%BA%BA%E8%8A%82.png/800px-%E6%83%85%E4%BA%BA%E8%8A%82.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a>\n</p></div>", "categories": [], "displaytitle": "主线故事/CG鉴赏"}}